OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper proposes estate of 152
OL,4,Aaffordable homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 152-home estate proposed for a
OL,7,Fvillage near Norwich would ease the
OL,8,Farea's need for affordable housing, a
OL,9,Fhousing association has said.
OL,11,FThe proposal for Thorpe End, on the
OL,12,Fnorth-east outskirts of the city, has
OL,13,Fbeen lodged with Broadland District
OL,14,FCouncil by Saffron Housing.
OL,16,FThe estate would be built south of
OL,17,FPlumstead Road, next to the Norwich to
OL,18,FCromer rail line at the edge of the
OL,19,Fvillage.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
